# "Sacrifice a Forest": with only a Mountain and a Lumberjack, and with Bot2's Forest on the battlefield (not Bot1's to
# sacrifice), an attempted activation is rolled back. With Bot1's own Forest played, it succeeds and produces {G}{G}{G}.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Orcish Lumberjack
Forest
Mountain x4
Mountain x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Forest x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Orcish Lumberjack.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Orcish Lumberjack.Activate
? Bot1.Battlefield = Mountain; Orcish Lumberjack
? Bot1.Battlefield.Orcish Lumberjack.Tapped = false
? Bot1.Mana =
? Bot1.Life = 20
? Bot2.Battlefield = Forest
? Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 0
? Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Orcish Lumberjack.Activate(Sacrifice: Forest; Colors: G,G,G)

[Expect]
Bot1.Mana = {G}{G}{G}
Bot1.Graveyard = Forest
Bot2.Battlefield = Forest
